From: ZN-M2 build compatibility <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] weechat: keep the virtual provider on the default variant only

Both variants declare PROVIDES:=weechat, while the minimal variant is the
default one and the full variant conflicts with it. Kconfig therefore selects
the default variant through the virtual symbol and reports a recursive
dependency:

  PACKAGE_luci-app-weechat depends on PACKAGE_weechat-full
  PACKAGE_weechat-full depends on PACKAGE_weechat-minimal
  PACKAGE_weechat-minimal is selected by PACKAGE_luci-app-weechat

Keep the virtual name provided by the default variant only; the full variant
still conflicts with it, so the two variants cannot be installed together.

--- a/net/weechat/Makefile
+++ b/net/weechat/Makefile
@@ -75,6 +75,5 @@
   TITLE+= (full with ncurses UI)
   DEPENDS+= +libncurses
   VARIANT:=full
-  PROVIDES:=weechat
   CONFLICTS:=weechat-minimal
 endef
